  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.3: aligned with Caveman core 1.4.3 (now referenced as a NuGet dependency instead of a project reference; 1.4.3 is a corrective re-publish of 1.4.2, which was missing several 1.4.x features). Catches this package up to three core versions of drift (1.3.1 to 1.4.x). TokenOptimizerPlugin.OptimizePrompt now accepts levels 0-5 (adds Statistical and Syntactic). Two new plugins: CavemanRetrievalPlugin (retrieve/retrieve_with_feedback, BM25+ ranking with optional RM3 pseudo-relevance feedback) and CavemanSummarizationPlugin (summarize_text with tfidf/textrank algorithms, summarize_text_topic_aware). CavemanServicesPlugin gains skeletonize_code (strips comments, collapses function bodies to signatures). CavemanConversationPlugin gains check_near_duplicate (SimHash-based near-duplicate detection, complements the existing exact-hash dedup_messages).",
